.env
node_modules/

# Downloaded sherpa-onnx / model caches (regenerated by setup-dev)
third_party/

# Dev tooling scripts: keep only the portable setup helpers, ignore the rest
# (eval corpora, private fixtures).
# ⚠️ `build-sidecar.mjs` **必须入库**（`predev`/`prebuild` 依赖它）——2026-10-17 v1.3.0
#    发布失败的根因就是它被 `scripts/*` 静默挡在仓库外：本地能跑、CI 全新检出
#    `MODULE_NOT_FOUND`。**今后 scripts/ 下新增"构建链路必需"脚本时，记得同步开例外。**
scripts/*
!scripts/setup-dev.sh
!scripts/setup-dev.ps1
!scripts/setup-dev.bat
!scripts/clean-dev.sh
!scripts/clean-dev.ps1
!scripts/clean-dev.bat
!scripts/build-sidecar.mjs

# GUI 测试运行时产物 (脚本本身入库)
